1
00:00:04,796 --> 00:00:06,586
So how long have you been in America?

2
00:00:06,756 --> 00:00:08,216
- A year and a half.
- No kidding.

3
00:00:08,383 --> 00:00:11,593
(Leonard:)- You speak English really well.
- So do you.

4
00:00:12,012 --> 00:00:16,432
(Dennis:)Except for your tendency
to end sentences with prepositions.

5
00:00:16,725 --> 00:00:18,975
(Leonard:)What are you talking about?

6
00:00:20,103 --> 00:00:22,023
(Sheldon:)That.

7
00:00:22,397 --> 00:00:23,687
(Sheldon:)He's not wrong.

8
00:00:24,733 --> 00:00:26,983
All right, and this is my office.

9
00:00:27,152 --> 00:00:29,572
- Is this part of the tour?
- Nope. Goodbye.

10
00:00:30,655 --> 00:00:32,695
(Sheldon:)Sheldon,
we've hardly shown him anything.

11
00:00:32,866 --> 00:00:36,496
All right, this is my desk.
These are my books.

12
00:00:36,661 --> 00:00:39,451
(Sheldon:)This is my door.
Please close it behind you, goodbye.

13
00:00:41,625 --> 00:00:43,955
(Dennis:)You're doing work
in quantum loop corrections.

14
00:00:44,127 --> 00:00:48,627
- Keen observation, goodbye.
- You see where you went wrong, don't you?

15
00:00:49,674 --> 00:00:50,964
(Sheldon:)- Leonard.
- Ha.

16
00:00:51,134 --> 00:00:53,974
(Leonard:)- Yeah?
- Get him out.

17
00:00:54,721 --> 00:00:57,851
Come, I'll show you the rec center.
They've got Nautilus equipment.

18
00:00:58,016 --> 00:01:01,026
Do I look like I lift weights?

